MIT License

This software is an original implementation of the Lossless Context Management
(LCM) architecture, specified in the paper "Lossless Context Management" by
Clint Ehrlich and Theodore Blackman, Voltropy PBC
(https://papers.voltropy.com/LCM). The paper is credited as the algorithmic
specification; all code in this repository was written from that spec.

The "smart zone" framing (quality degradation at a token budget, not the
window limit) is credited to Matt Pocock, AI Coding Dictionary
(https://www.aihero.dev/ai-coding-dictionary/smart-zone).

